{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Land</strong> is a cozy building and restoration game about healing a broken world with the help of friendly eco-technology. Clean up pollution, recycle debris, and guide nature back to life as barren land slowly transforms into a thriving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in a damaged landscape filled with trash, oil, and scorched ground. With only a small eco-bot and a handful of tools, you start restoring the land one action at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Living Habitat </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants, structures, and restoration tools to shape the land. As conditions improve, nature responds. Grass cascades across the terrain, trees take root, and the ecosystem begins to sustain itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attract and Care for Wildlife</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=598 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the land recovers, animals return. Different species thrive under different conditions, and their presence reflects the health of the ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create safe, balanced habitats and watch animals explore, interact, and settle into the world you\u2019ve restored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress and Unlock New Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=598 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn eco points by cleaning, recycling, and restoring the land. Unlock new buildings, upgrades, and restoration technologies as each stage is completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step forward, you gain new ways to clean faster, restore larger areas, and guide the ecosystem toward long-term sustainability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132310?t=1769101744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132310?t=1769101744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/f68ddc43fedbcdde2aac2381643c36aa90bd6acd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769101744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/f68ddc43fedbcdde2aac2381643c36aa90bd6acd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769101744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Land</strong> is a cozy building and restoration game about healing a broken world with the help of friendly eco-technology. Clean up pollution, recycle debris, and guide nature back to life as barren land slowly transforms into a thriving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in a damaged landscape filled with trash, oil, and scorched ground. With only a small eco-bot and a handful of tools, you start restoring the land one action at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Living Habitat </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/5f3dff5bfba16d1f2fc139eba228ca0b.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants, structures, and restoration tools to shape the land. As conditions improve, nature responds. Grass cascades across the terrain, trees take root, and the ecosystem begins to sustain itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attract and Care for Wildlife</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=598 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/3b73877c68400b528a338bea256c7101.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the land recovers, animals return. Different species thrive under different conditions, and their presence reflects the health of the ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create safe, balanced habitats and watch animals explore, interact, and settle into the world you\u2019ve restored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress and Unlock New Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.poster.avif?t=1769101744\" width=598 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.webm?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/8bf15e2ad9c73c4b8a2fea1ee34d228f.mp4?t=1769101744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn eco points by cleaning, recycling, and restoring the land. Unlock new buildings, upgrades, and restoration technologies as each stage is completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step forward, you gain new ways to clean faster, restore larger areas, and guide the ecosystem toward long-term sustainability.</p>","developers":["Ralph Schaedler"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/02949684098ef295b98ec9d02c8e91c677ebdf0a/header.jpg?t=1769101744","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132310/1058716465/47c5c4933d1d8f82a3bd22979b83b96941992cfd/1768320749/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768328677","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132310/1058716465/47c5c4933d1d8f82a3bd22979b83b96941992cfd/1768320749/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768328677","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132310/1058716465/47c5c4933d1d8f82a3bd22979b83b96941992cfd/1768320749/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768328677","id":257224610,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224610/c17a0bf4cbf7de273f3cc51de7b8ada0c08892cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768328677"}],"name":"Open Land","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7360U or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 480</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7360U or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD RX 570</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux"